                <note rend="inline" type="source">694.001/8–1150</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Consultant to the Secretary</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Dulles</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1950-08-11">August 11, 1950</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In pursuance of our talk last evening, I enclose a memorandum outlining possible
                    next steps with relation to a Japan Treaty.</p>


